{"title":"Nengiren&#8217;s Embroidered Little Woman","link":"https://kottke.org/25/10/nengirens-embroidered-little-woman","date":1760968322000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1626\" alt=\"Nine embroidered figures in vibrant, uniquely patterned coats with geometric and floral motifs\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1734\" alt=\"Embroidered figure in green leaf-patterned outfit with orange center panel containing three black circles\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1732\" alt=\"Embroidered figure in blue scalloped coat with three black ovals, against orange checkered background\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-04.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-04.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/nengiren-04.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1625\" alt=\"Grid of 25 whimsical embroidered figures with colorful patterned coats, black hair, and boots\" /></p>\n\n<p>How cool are these embroidered Nona Kecil (“little woman”) figures by Indonesian artist Irene Saputra, aka <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/nengiren/\">Nengiren</a>. She <a href=\"https://www.thisiscolossal.com/2024/01/nengiren-nona-kecil/\">explained to Colossal</a> what the figures signify:</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>Nona Kecil’s evolution mirrors my own journey as an artist. Initially, she adorned simple OOTDs with muted colors and straightforward patterns. However, the turning point occurred three years ago when I embraced motherhood. Balancing time between my son and art intensified my experimentation, leading Nona Kecil to explore more expressive and elaborate outfits.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>(via <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/antichrista/\">@antichrista</a>)</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/embroidery\">embroidery</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Nengiren\">Nengiren</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/10/nengirens-embroidered-little-woman\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"45d3f85604b7434336d424599772eed50551912afed88baa2a4cf6986c3e8418","category":"Sites"}